h tersebut dalam keadaan bertutup dan berkunci. Kami telah memberi salam dan l/k 07 minit menunggu masih lagi tiada respon dari penghuni. Pada waktu itu tiada kelibat jiran-jiran disekitar untuk bertanyakan status berkenaan penghuni rumah tersebut. Seterusnya kami bertindak beredar dari lokasi untuk melaksanakan tugasan seterusnya. Sekian laporan saya.\", \"alamat_pejabat\": \"HQ SHAH ALAM\", \"jumlah_perlaksanaan\": \"1\", \"hasil_perlaksanaan_id\": \"19\", \"tindakan_oleh_staff_id\": \"112\", \"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\": \"2026-04-30T21:50\"}','2026-04-24 11:50:17','2026-04-24 11:50:17'),(640,56,'App\\Models\\IwaranWarrant',1,'i-waran','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/i-waran/1','PUT','218.208.68.26','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\"]','{\"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\": \"2026-04-30 21:50:00\"}','{\"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\": \"2026-04-30T21:50\"}','2026-04-24 11:50:39','2026-04-24 11:50:39'),(641,22,'App\\Models\\Complaint',5,'aduan','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints/5/ak','POST','203.106.211.49','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"received_at\", \"ak_charge_recommendations\"]','{\"received_at\": \"2026-04-24T03:47:45.000000Z\", \"ak_charge_recommendations\": [{\"name\": \"\", \"portfolio\": \"\", \"offense_id\": 39}]}','{\"received_at\": \"2026-04-24T03:52:32.904369Z\", \"ak_charge_recommendations\": [{\"name\": \"\", \"portfolio\": \"\", \"offense_id\": 39}]}','2026-04-24 11:52:32','2026-04-24 11:52:32'),(642,22,'App\\Models\\Complaint',5,'aduan','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints/5/basic','POST','203.106.211.49','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"received_at\"]','{\"received_at\": \"2026-04-24T03:52:32.000000Z\"}','{\"received_at\": \