AR UTAMA BERTUTUP, BERKUNCI DAN BERMANGGA. TERDAPAT SUSUNAN KASUT DEWASA LELAKI DI LUAR PINTU PAGAR UTAMA. KAMI MENGESYAKI PENGHUNI RUMAH TELAH KELUAR PADA KETIKA ITU. KAMI MENCADANGKAN WARAN DIKELUARKAN SEKALI LAGI SEKIRANYA PENAMA WARAN TIDAK HADIR SEPERTI MANA KETETAPAN MAHKAMAH. KAMI MENINGGALKAN SESALINAN WARAN TANGKAP DI BAWAH PINTU PAGAR UTAMA. SETELAH BERPUAS HATI, KAMI BEREDAR DAN MENERUSKAN TUGASAN YANG LAIN. SEKIAN, LAPORAN SAYA.\", \"tarikh_masa_terima\": \"2026-05-11T15:17\", \"jumlah_perlaksanaan\": \"1\", \"hasil_perlaksanaan_id\": \"12\", \"tindakan_oleh_staff_id\": \"113\", \"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\": \"2026-05-18T21:30\"}','2026-05-19 08:53:11','2026-05-19 08:53:11'),(2614,NULL,'App\\Models\\Complaint',192,'aduan','created','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints','POST','203.106.211.161','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"reference_no\", \"case_type\", \"complaint_year\", \"complaint_date\", \"complaint_time\", \"incident_date\", \"incident_time\", \"complainant_name\", \"identification_number\", \"contact_number\", \"informant_name\", \"informant_identification_number\", \"informant_contact_number\", \"complainant_occupation\", \"address\", \"district_id\", \"district_name\", \"summary\", \"borang5_statement\", \"aj_offense_id\", \"ak_offense_id\", \"ak_subtype\", \"ak_partner_name\", \"ak_cerai_count\", \"ak_cerai_talaq_count\", \"ak_poligami_marriage_count\", \"ak_poligami_wife_count\", \"ak_event_date\", \"ak_event_place\", \"ak_event_time\", \"current_address\", \"ak_rujuk_date\", \"channel\", \"consent_accepted\", \"consent_accepted_at\", \"consent_text_version\", \"consent_ip_address\", \"consent_user_agent\", \"current_stage\", \"status_id\", \"approver_confirmed_at\", \"submitted_at\", \"submitted_by_user_id\", \"updated_at\", \"created_at\", \"id\"]',NULL,'{\"id\": 192, \"address\": \"-\", \"channel\": \"walkin\", \"summary\": \"\", \"case_type\": 