. Alamat berjaya dijumpai.Telah berjumpa dengan Puan NOORIDA SARI BINTI HAMYUSSIN yang berjawatan Penolong Pengurus Sumber Manusia di syarikat tersebut. Beliau menyatakan pemana masih bekerja. Kami meminta pihak syarikat untuk memaklumkan kepada penama dan mengarahkan untuk hadir ke Mahkamah pada tarikh yang ditetapkan. Setelah berpuas hati kami beredar melaksanakan waran ditempat lain.\", \"tarikh_masa_terima\": \"2026-04-06T12:07\", \"jumlah_perlaksanaan\": \"1\", \"hasil_perlaksanaan_id\": \"12\", \"tindakan_oleh_staff_id\": \"28\", \"tarikh_masa_perlaksanaan_1\": \"2026-06-08T10:30\"}','2026-06-08 12:45:38','2026-06-08 12:45:38'),(3995,NULL,'App\\Models\\Complaint',330,'aduan','created','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints','POST','218.208.68.26','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"reference_no\", \"case_type\", \"complaint_year\", \"complaint_date\", \"complaint_time\", \"incident_date\", \"incident_time\", \"complainant_name\", \"identification_number\", \"contact_number\", \"informant_name\", \"informant_identification_number\", \"informant_contact_number\", \"complainant_occupation\", \"address\", \"district_id\", \"district_name\", \"summary\", \"borang5_statement\", \"aj_offense_id\", \"ak_offense_id\", \"ak_subtype\", \"ak_partner_name\", \"ak_cerai_count\", \"ak_cerai_talaq_count\", \"ak_poligami_marriage_count\", \"ak_poligami_wife_count\", \"ak_event_date\", \"ak_event_place\", \"ak_event_time\", \"current_address\", \"ak_rujuk_date\", \"channel\", \"consent_accepted\", \"consent_accepted_at\", \"consent_text_version\", \"consent_ip_address\", \"consent_user_agent\", \"current_stage\", \"status_id\", \"approver_confirmed_at\", \"submitted_at\", \"submitted_by_user_id\", \"updated_at\", \"created_at\", \"id\"]',NULL,'{\"id\": 330, \"address\": \"-\", \"channel\": \"walkin\", \"summary\": \"\", \"case_type\": \"AK\", \"status_id\": 1, \"ak_subtype\": \"nikah\", \"cre