IKA PERNIKAHAN DILAKUKAN SECARA TANPA KEBENARAN MAHKAMAH, PERKAHWINAN INI JUGA TELAH LEWAT / TIDAK DILAPORKAN DALAM TEMPOH YANG DITETAPKAN DI BAWAH SEKSYEN 31.\\nKETIKA PERNIKAHAN BERLAKU SAYA TELAH MEMPUNYAI ISTERI YANG SAH BERNAMA ZAINAB BINTI ISMAIL NO.K/P: 740209-03-5604 TELAH DINIKAHI PADA 21 OKTOBER 1999 DI TEMPAT:KELANTAN. PERNIKAHAN INI SECARA POLIGAMI TANPA KEBENARAN DAN TIDAK MENDAPATKAN KEBENARAN BERNIKAH DI LUAR DARI PEJABAT AGAMA ISLAM DAERAH YANG BERBIDANGKUASA.\\n\\nSaya bersedia memberi kerjasama jika diperlukan.\", \"consent_ip_address\": null, \"consent_user_agent\": null, \"consent_accepted_at\": null, \"ak_cerai_talaq_count\": null, \"consent_text_version\": null, \"submitted_by_user_id\": 15, \"approver_confirmed_at\": null, \"identification_number\": \"710327-03-5579\", \"ak_poligami_wife_count\": 2, \"complainant_occupation\": \"PESARA KERAJAAN\", \"informant_contact_number\": \"014-3500140\", \"ak_poligami_marriage_count\": 2, \"informant_identification_number\": \"710327-03-5579\"}','2026-06-16 09:29:37','2026-06-16 09:29:37'),(4756,15,'App\\Models\\Complaint',412,'aduan','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints/412/pickup','POST','175.136.255.185','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"received_by_user_id\", \"received_at\"]','{\"received_at\": null, \"received_by_user_id\": null}','{\"received_at\": \"2026-06-16T01:29:37.487967Z\", \"received_by_user_id\": 15}','2026-06-16 09:29:37','2026-06-16 09:29:37'),(4757,15,'App\\Models\\Complaint',412,'aduan','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints/412/ak','POST','175.136.255.185','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"status_id\", \"current_stage\", \"received_at\", \"approver_staff_id\", \"approver_confirmed_at\", \"ak_offense_id\", \"ak_email_cc\", \"ak_charge_recommendations\", \"ak_prosecution_charges\"]','{\"st