SELANGOR) NO.9 TAHUN 1995.\", \"directive_at\": null, \"female_count\": null, \"report_notes\": \"Bertindak atas aduan AJ-GOMBAK/2026/06/0169 l/k jam 12.54 malam saya bersama-sama PPA Rezman bin Abdullah dan PPA Muhammad Fathul Adib bin Azhar telah membuat pemeriksaan di premis beralamat Lot 95A Jalan 5, Kampung Sri Indah A, 47000 Sg Buloh, Selangor. Hasil pemeriksaan di premis tersebut mendapati rumah tersebut merupakan sebuah rumah tinggal. Tiada penghuni di dalam premis tersebut. Setelah berpuas hati kami beredar dari lokasi. Tiada sebarang perlanggaran enakmen berlaku. Sekian laporan saya.\", \"arrest_status\": \"tiada\", \"district_name\": \"Gombak\", \"complaint_year\": 2026, \"current_status\": null, \"op_case_status\": null, \"seizure_status\": \"tiada\", \"action_datetime\": \"2026-07-01T02:00\", \"arrest_staff_id\": \"36\", \"directive_notes\": null, \"case_register_no\": \"KES-Gombak/2026/06/0188\", \"handover_staff_id\": null, \"prosecution_notes\": null, \"report_offense_id\": \"26\", \"created_by_user_id\": 41, \"directive_staff_id\": null, \"ppa_classification\": null, \"prosecution_status\": null, \"statement_datetime\": null, \"investigation_notes\": null, \"prosecutor_staff_id\": null, \"supervisor_staff_id\": null, \"current_status_other\": null, \"police_report_status\": \"tiada\", \"charge_recommendations\": null, \"inspection_form_status\": \"tiada\"}','2026-06-30 18:07:40','2026-06-30 18:07:40'),(6177,41,'App\\Models\\CaseRecord',142,'kes','updated','https://hotline.jais.gov.my/api/complaints/525/cases','POST','203.106.211.97','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','[\"laporan_tindakan_auto_emailed_at\", \"updated_by_user_id\"]','{\"updated_by_user_id\": null, \"laporan_tindakan_auto_emailed_at\": null}','{\"updated_by_user_id\": 41, \"laporan_tindakan_auto_emailed_at\": \"2026-06-30T18:07:44.389306Z\"}','2026-06-30 18:07:44','2026-06-30 18:07:44'),(6178,41,'App\\Models